442	Note the one-sided gating on $\gamma$: the commutation check and the $\mathsf{Pair}$ consistency check accept automatically when $\gamma \neq 0$, while the Magic Square check and the $\mathsf{Variable}$ consistency check accept automatically when $\gamma = 0$.
